## outside
error[Z0701]: path `../shared/wages.csv` is outside the project
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:16
  |
1 | let d = import("../shared/wages.csv")
  |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ projects read only their own files and declared data roots
  |
  = help: declare the folder under [data] in zeff.toml and write `import("shared:wages.csv")`, or copy the file into data/

## absolute
error[Z0701]: path `/etc/passwd` is outside the project
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:16
  |
1 | let d = import("/etc/passwd")
  |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ projects read only their own files and declared data roots
  |
  = help: declare the folder under [data] in zeff.toml and write `import("shared:passwd")`, or copy the file into data/

